Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.39,0:00:06.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这是要我们走向死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}You would have us march to our end?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.64,0:00:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这是要大家得到自由\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would have us free.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.41,0:00:09.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管有没有你\N{\fnArial\fs30}With or without you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.32,0:00:11.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都要向罗马进军\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall march upon Rome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.59,0:00:15.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是马科斯•克拉苏的奴隶\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were slave to Marcus Crassus himself?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.67,0:00:16.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.44,0:00:19.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么她还是不顾一切地离开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would she risk all to fly from loving arms?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.58,0:00:23.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天我们跟克雷斯同去罗马\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tomorrow we move for rome with Crixus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.25,0:00:24.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我要你和斯巴达克斯一起走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet I would have you take with Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.04,0:00:26.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要永远在你身边\N{\fnArial\fs30}My place is forever with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.48,0:00:28.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not in this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.71,0:00:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个妓女坎莎拉说她看到你从克芮帐篷里出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}The whore Canthara tells of how she saw you come from Kore's tent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.10,0:00:33.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,别装了 小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Game is over boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.01,0:00:38.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟娘们一样被爆菊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it like a woman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.41,0:00:41.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗马 终于近在咫尺了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rome at last lies within our grasp!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.10,0:01:01.48,Title,0,0,0,0,,《斯巴达克斯：诅咒者之战》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.72,0:01:04.31,Title,0,0,0,0,,《血祭亡魂》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.91,0:01:16.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们这些人就吃一只兔子\N{\fnArial\fs30}One fucking hare between us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.50,0:01:20.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,小声点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lower voice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.23,0:01:24.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不像个孩子似的 还怕黑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not tremble in the dark as frightened child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.67,0:01:38.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,火把拿到面前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carry torch forward!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.51,0:02:02.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,下次换你拿弓箭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time next, you carry bow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.51,0:02:05.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,老娘都没时间玩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too far from fucking blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.26,0:02:06.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,取走他们的武器和盔甲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strip them of weapons and armor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.22,0:02:08.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有他们带的粮草\N{\fnArial\fs30}and what supplies they yet carry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.39,0:02:12.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是从北方来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}These men travel from the north.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.89,0:02:15.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,克拉苏派他们来这儿干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What purpose would Crassus have there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.10,0:02:20.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他手下的人都有公牛的徽记\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those who follow him are known by mark of the bull.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.80,0:02:25.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不是克拉苏的手下\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are not his men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.39,0:02:28.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,雄鹰和海豚\N{\fnArial\fs30}The eagle and the dolphin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.75,0:02:34.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我见过这样的标志\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have laid eyes upon crest before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.87,0:02:38.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,是格涅乌斯•庞培•麦格勒斯的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mark of Gnaeus Pompeius Magnus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.37,0:02:38.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,庞培\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pompey?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.21,0:02:41.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他水战陆战都精通\N{\fnArial\fs30}A master of both land and sea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.78,0:02:44.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我丈夫对他敬仰已久\N{\fnArial\fs30}My husband spoke with deep admiration of the man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.19,0:02:46.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,常说他是罗马最伟大的战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bending tongue to welcome him as Rome's greatest warrior{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.86,0:02:48.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说过他的本事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have heard tale of his conquests.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.35,0:02:52.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,也知道他少年屠夫的大名\N{\fnArial\fs30}And name of Adolescent Butcher given him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.41,0:02:54.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们屠了他的鸟和鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}We shall butcher bird and fish!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.66,0:02:57.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为庞培正忙于对战塞多留的叛军\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought Pompey mired in Hispania against the renegade Sertorius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.09,0:03:00.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,正因为他不在 才由克拉苏率军与我们交战\N{\fnArial\fs30}His absence the reason Crassus took arms against us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.62,0:03:03.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然庞培的探子回了共和国\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Pompey's scouts return to the Republic, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.70,0:03:05.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不出一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}as night follows day, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.67,0:03:09.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就会带领人马尾随而来\N{\fnArial\fs30}the man and his legions will trail their shadow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.05,0:03:11.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.87,0:03:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个骑马的过来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A rider approaches.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.22,0:03:18.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,说不定是声东击西\N{\fnArial\fs30}This may hold but distraction!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.32,0:03:22.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,两翼有动静就报个信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give voice if eyes fall upon movement upon flanks!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.17,0:03:30.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他穿着罗马军队的斗篷\N{\fnArial\fs30}They wear cloak of the fucking legion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.11,0:03:36.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是罗马人\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is no Roman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.41,0:04:11.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,喝点吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drink.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.90,0:04:13.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,没必要浪费在死人身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not waste such on the dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.40,0:04:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}You yet live.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.28,0:04:24.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不过是个影子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I a but pale shade, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.68,0:04:28.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,游荡在空虚的世间罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}haunting a world fallen from meaning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.33,0:04:31.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们也要照看好你的魂灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we must nourish specter, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.25,0:04:34.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你重获生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}so that it may reclaim flesh{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.06,0:04:36.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,迎接美好的未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and promise of better days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.73,0:04:39.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我眼中看不到未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}There stand none upon horizon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.89,0:04:58.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是如他梦想的那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was his end as he had always dreamed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.14,0:05:00.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,在战场上光荣战死吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}In glorious battle?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.12,0:05:02.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,是战场没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}In battle, yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.52,0:05:05.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,却毫无光荣可言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Though robbed of glory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.39,0:05:09.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,说出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.04,0:05:12.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你心里会好受一些\N{\fnArial\fs30}That we may share in the burden of grief.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.89,0:05:21.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们跟你分开后 一路获胜\N{\fnArial\fs30}The days after we parted were filled with victory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.62,0:05:34.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,敌人的鲜血染红了大地\N{\fnArial\fs30}The blood of our enemies turning fields to crimson mud, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.54,0:05:36.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,尸首枕藉\N{\fnArial\fs30}thick with the dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.67,0:05:41.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗马近在咫尺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rome lay within our grasp.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.63,0:05:49.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,胜利却被克拉苏和他的军队夺走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only to have it snatched from us by Crassus and his legions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.01,0:05:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他亲手\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was the man himself{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.95,0:05:58.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了克雷斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}that robbed Crixus' life?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.40,0:06:02.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,克雷斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crixus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.03,0:06:09.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,克雷斯和叛徒恺撒交手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crixus was engaged by the traitor Caesar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.28,0:06:13.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个乳臭未干的小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}When boy of scant years{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.87,0:06:21.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,一矛从背后戳穿了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}pierced back with spear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.01,0:06:32.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,操蛋的兔崽子\N{\fnArial\fs30}A fucking boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.13,0:06:36.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾力冈呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What of Agron?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.70,0:06:40.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他与克雷斯共赴黄泉了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does he share fate with Crixus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.55,0:06:42.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是依然活在世上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or is he yet of this world?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.24,0:06:59.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,克拉苏放我一条生路 就是为了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is but single reason crassus spare my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.04,0:07:04.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘲讽斯巴达克斯只能有如此下场\N{\fnArial\fs30}To taunt Spartacus with vision of his end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.38,0:07:17.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,克拉苏想刺激你做出傻事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crassus tempts to goad you into foolish action.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.36,0:07:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,若不是要为其他人的生命负责\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I stood only for my own life, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.56,0:07:22.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我会那么冲动\N{\fnArial\fs30}perhaps I would stand so moved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.18,0:07:24.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们不能那样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet we must turn from such thoughts, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.38,0:07:27.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,要考虑迫在眉睫的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}and set purpose towards more pressing concern.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.03,0:07:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,庞培\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pompey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.90,0:07:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他派兵南去 找克拉苏的军队\N{\fnArial\fs30}His scouts were headed south, towards Crassus' legions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.79,0:07:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果信使不回去 他还会派出更多\N{\fnArial\fs30}He will send more, when they do not return.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.14,0:07:38.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们合二为一 两面夹击 我们难以抵挡\N{\fnArial\fs30}We cannot afford to be caught between two armies, fighting as one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.83,0:07:40.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,的确不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. We cannot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.51,0:07:48.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,高卢人的手下没一个开口的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}None among the Gaul's men form words of note?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.94,0:07:52.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了让他们开口 我们用了鞭刑和烙刑\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have set lash and heated iron towards the loosening of tongues.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.23,0:07:54.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会不断施压 直到有人松口\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall press until one unmoors from stubborn tether.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.28,0:07:57.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然就把他们的舌头统统拔了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or command all torn from rebellious root.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.14,0:07:59.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没时间也没精力为这种事分心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have time nor patience to pause for such distraction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.08,0:08:01.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,传令下去 太阳东升之时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give word to break encampment{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.53,0:08:03.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就启程\N{\fnArial\fs30}as Apollo approaches eastern sky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.35,0:08:04.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要加快脚步\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would quicken pace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.81,0:08:07.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,随从营地里发生了一件小事\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is a matter of some small concern within the followers' camp.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.48,0:08:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个叫坎莎拉的妓女\N{\fnArial\fs30}A whore by the name of Canthara, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.40,0:08:14.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,遭人毒打 从下体到喉咙都被割开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}discovered beaten and slit as pig from womanhood to throat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.63,0:08:18.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,坎莎拉 你知道这件事吗 恺撒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Canthara? What do you know of this, Caesar?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.29,0:08:21.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}News only now falls upon ear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.89,0:08:24.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找这个女人好几天了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have been seeking the woman for several days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.29,0:08:27.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论她惹了谁 这人的报复心可不容小觑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoever she angered, his wrath is a thing to be feared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.44,0:08:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,随从营地离我军很近\N{\fnArial\fs30}Followers' camp is but brief step from our very ranks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.50,0:08:33.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,决不容许出现骚乱和谋杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would not have it fall to chaos and murder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.19,0:08:34.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会亲自处理这件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall personally attend to matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.27,0:08:37.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望凶手血债血偿\N{\fnArial\fs30}May those responsible suffer equal fate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.09,0:08:39.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,报告\N{\fnArial\fs30}Imperator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.93,0:08:41.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,有两名士兵骑马前来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two soldiers approach on horseback, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.84,0:08:43.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,佩戴庞培的徽章\N{\fnArial\fs30}bearing crest of Pompey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.09,0:08:46.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,屠夫终于露脸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The butcher at last reveals himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.67,0:08:50.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他们带到我的大帐里\N{\fnArial\fs30}See them to my praetorium.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.80,0:08:58.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,格涅乌斯•庞培•麦格勒斯总督\N{\fnArial\fs30}Proconsul Gnaeu Pompeius Magnus…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.26,0:09:02.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿与您携手剿灭叛贼斯巴达克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}offers support in campaign against the rebel Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.48,0:09:07.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这话可真是出乎意料\N{\fnArial\fs30}Offer greeted with wondrous surprise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.22,0:09:11.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,若非关乎自身利益 庞培从未协助过任何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never known Pompey to support any cause but his own interests.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.37,0:09:13.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apologies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.26,0:09:14.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只负责传信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I but carry message.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.87,0:09:17.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有什么要说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmmm, see remainder fall from tongue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.25,0:09:19.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,庞培要求会面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pompey requests meeting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.30,0:09:24.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果要见面 他为何不亲自前来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why does he not appear before us himself, if taken by such desire?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.41,0:09:26.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他不是傻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because he does not stand the fool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.44,0:09:28.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.94,0:09:31.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会冒险前往你们的营地\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will not risk journey to your commander's camp.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.03,0:09:33.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不会放弃指挥权\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nor will I break from my charge{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.97,0:09:36.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,对那个自以为是的家伙卑躬屈膝\N{\fnArial\fs30}to bow and scrap before imagined titan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.88,0:09:39.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,庞培想在两军之间会面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pompey seeks but neutral ground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.47,0:09:42.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他带二十个随从 您也一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twenty men attending him, to be met in kind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.24,0:09:50.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要考虑一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will consider terms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.90,0:09:53.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,给他们吃的喝的\N{\fnArial\fs30}See them to food and wine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.26,0:09:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,告退\N{\fnArial\fs30}Imperator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.12,0:10:01.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,您不是真的考虑跟他会面吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You cannot seriously be turning offer upon mind?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.74,0:10:03.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,庞培只是想利用您对斯巴达克斯的了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pompey but seeks your knowledge of Spartacus{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.43,0:10:06.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,窃取我们的胜利果实\N{\fnArial\fs30}so that he may snatch victory from deserving hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.81,0:10:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,恺撒 你同意我的说法吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caesar, you agree, do you not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.78,0:10:12.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也有和你一样的顾虑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I share your concerns.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.86,0:10:15.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,但庞培打败塞多留后荣耀加身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet Pompey returns the hero against Sertorius, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.12,0:10:17.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,携英雄之名归来\N{\fnArial\fs30}ripe with laurels.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.49,0:10:19.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,拒绝他的协助 也许他视其为侮辱\N{\fnArial\fs30}To refuse offer would be considered insult.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.75,0:10:23.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,到时候他在元老院中以此对你不利\N{\fnArial\fs30}One that could be set against you within the Senate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.69,0:10:24.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,去他妈的元老院\N{\fnArial\fs30}To shit with the Senate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.89,0:10:28.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟他联手还有一个实际的好处\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is practical reason as well to accept terms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.03,0:10:33.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以从南边进攻\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could press attack from the south, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.51,0:10:34.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,而庞培可以阻止\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pompey could stay Spartacus{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.85,0:10:37.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯遁入山中逃跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}from gaining the mountains and slipping from grasp.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.81,0:10:39.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,一网打尽\N{\fnArial\fs30}With all who follow him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.64,0:10:43.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我决不能放他们逃走\N{\fnArial\fs30}A thing I would not see come to pass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.44,0:10:44.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,父亲 您不能去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father, you cannot go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.83,0:10:47.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样一来 庞培成了发号施令的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would appear Pompey commands you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.08,0:10:48.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一点我也考虑过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Again, I share concern.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.20,0:10:51.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能给他低人一等的印象\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should give no impression that you are beneath him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.72,0:10:55.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,派个有头有脸的人物代你去谈判即可\N{\fnArial\fs30}Instead send honored name in your place to broach negotiation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.81,0:10:58.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜你说的那位人物就是恺撒吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I suppose such name holds letters forming "Caesar"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.56,0:11:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 只有代统帅行使权力的人才\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Only the imperator's word{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.62,0:11:04.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,有这个资格\N{\fnArial\fs30}and will holds such lofty position.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.88,0:11:06.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,庞培是个精明的对手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pompey stands shrewd opponent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.76,0:11:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望找个经验更丰富的人来对付他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would have one of more seasoned years to set against him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.11,0:11:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,提比略提出过良策 证明了他的能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tiberius has proven himself worthy advisory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.20,0:11:15.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,看他年纪轻轻 庞培自然也会掉以轻心\N{\fnArial\fs30}His youth will but cause Pompey to lower his guard, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.56,0:11:17.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,最终要他后悔莫及\N{\fnArial\fs30}to deepest regret.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.46,0:11:22.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,恺撒终于说了几句我爱听的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caesar at last breaks words that I am moved to embrace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.82,0:11:28.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在你回来前暂且按兵不动\N{\fnArial\fs30}We shall pause advance until your return.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.52,0:11:32.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞清庞培的真实意图 但不要涉及关键问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weigh Pompey's true intent yet give upon no issue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.96,0:11:36.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我代表父亲 必定不辱您的威名\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall stand as my father, unforgiving in command.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.92,0:11:43.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,转变可以如此之快吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was it so short a span, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.69,0:11:46.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不久前他还是个迷茫的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}when he stood uncertain boy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.77,0:11:48.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些日子已经随风而去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Such days have faded from memory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.59,0:11:51.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他现在是个顶天立地的男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He stands a man now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.45,0:11:54.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望他得到应得的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I wish for him all that he deserves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.61,0:11:58.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没注意防守\N{\fnArial\fs30}You lower the fucking guard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.17,0:12:00.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要拿我当罗马人 拿命来拼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do so against the Roman, fought your ass!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.86,0:12:01.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,纳西尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nasir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.56,0:12:05.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是新兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Point new army.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.14,0:12:08.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住我给你上的这堂课\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take me upon a lesson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.44,0:12:15.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 我们吃点东西去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come, let's feel so content as well{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.78,0:12:17.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no desire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.52,0:12:19.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,说两句也不愿意吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}No larish words?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.00,0:12:29.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要打起精神 兴许有好消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have taken nonsense and fortunate news.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.01,0:12:31.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,还真能说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You bold say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.04,0:12:36.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,可惜你跟他根本就不是一路人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does not lift spirit now in the man sill between you and your heart{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.16,0:12:38.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这话说出来毫无作用\N{\fnArial\fs30}forever removed from path.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.15,0:12:40.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟艾力冈有过节\N{\fnArial\fs30}I often disagreement with Agron, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.19,0:12:42.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不代表我不关心他的命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}yet I am not absent feeling towards his fate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.27,0:12:45.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及为他伤心的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or wounded upon the one he deserving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.87,0:12:48.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这是要乘虚而入吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You take it fucking opportunity?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.26,0:12:51.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想给你信心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I seek only to give confidence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.42,0:12:53.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还有这样的心思\N{\fnArial\fs30}You seek what you always have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.01,0:12:55.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾力冈就因为这个才走的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agron has gone because of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.18,0:12:56.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不在了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.80,0:12:59.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,是因为他自己做的决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}because he made choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.89,0:13:01.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是因为我才死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is gone because of me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.77,0:13:02.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,若非他发现我看你的眼神\N{\fnArial\fs30}He would not leave with Crixus{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.83,0:13:05.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就不会跟克雷斯走\N{\fnArial\fs30}if he did not see the way my eyes fell upon you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.04,0:13:14.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的生活够苦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only thing the time we live{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.62,0:13:19.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,但愿诸神不要再折磨我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the gods turn away the suffering.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.74,0:13:44.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你曾是马科斯•克拉苏的奴隶吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were slave to Marcus Crassus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.65,0:13:50.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,在米利亚峰从他营中逃脱的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The one that slipped from him upon Melia Ridge?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.75,0:13:53.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说过传言\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have heard rumor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.18,0:13:55.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,说他曾宠幸过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}That he was of a favor towards you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.73,0:13:59.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,确实有过这样一段日子\N{\fnArial\fs30}There stood such a time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.96,0:14:01.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你一定跟他很亲近吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you were of a closeness to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.65,0:14:04.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你逃跑之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before you fled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.19,0:14:06.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我那晚在他的帐篷中\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shared his tent that night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.78,0:14:10.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拿着刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}I took knife and{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.44,0:14:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,趁他睡着悄悄溜走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}slipped from presence while he slept.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.53,0:14:15.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么没有趁机下手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you not seize opportunity?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.58,0:14:18.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,结束他的性命\N{\fnArial\fs30}And end his life?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.96,0:14:23.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果克拉苏那晚死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Crassus had fallen that night, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.86,0:14:27.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,那克雷斯就不会离开人世了\N{\fnArial\fs30}then Crixus would yet be of this world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.61,0:14:31.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为你失去爱人深感痛心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am moved by your loss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.92,0:14:33.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我不该为此负责\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet I cannot be held for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.86,0:14:35.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都该为自己的行为负责\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are all held for our actions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.35,0:14:39.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们做出的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}The choices we make.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.12,0:14:40.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们所做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}The things that we do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.87,0:14:44.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们本该做却没有做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}And those that we should have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.73,0:14:47.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们无法让太阳西升东落\N{\fnArial\fs30}We cannot reverse the sun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.30,0:14:50.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,也无法让时光倒流\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nor relive days past.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.23,0:14:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.43,0:14:55.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只能准备迎接不确定的未来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can but brace against uncertain future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.96,0:15:00.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,等时机一到\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when moment presents, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.71,0:15:06.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,让那些伤心欲绝的人得到安慰\N{\fnArial\fs30}balance scale against those who have most deeply wounded heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.87,0:15:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,通知庞培我到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Inform Pompey of my arrival.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.85,0:15:56.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,守在我旁边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay at my side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.33,0:16:00.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他敢稍有动作 就拔剑\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the man makes but slightest move, unleash sword.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.03,0:16:03.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们和你的将军说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us break words with your commander.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.51,0:16:05.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,听听他有什么要说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And divine his intent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.37,0:16:07.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他非常热切地盼望见到您\N{\fnArial\fs30}He stands most eager to greet you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.52,0:16:16.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,尊敬的庞培\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honored Pompey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.19,0:16:19.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,家父深表遗憾 他不能…\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father sends regret that he could not{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.41,0:16:20.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,感到遗憾是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}The regret is mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.83,0:16:27.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我原以为会见到统帅本人呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had hoped to embrace the Imperator himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.93,0:16:32.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果送上门的只是克拉苏的小崽子而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet fate delivers mere shadow of the name Crassus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.73,0:16:59.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这把剑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this the blade?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.89,0:17:04.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,夺走了克雷斯的性命吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}The one that robbed Crixus of his life?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.64,0:17:10.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,把这小子的手下都绑起来带走\N{\fnArial\fs30}See the boy's men bound and readied for march.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.12,0:17:12.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.93,0:17:15.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要留他们的性命吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You would keep them alive?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.36,0:17:18.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要用他们来向死者献祭\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would see them give honor to the dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.75,0:17:20.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后再要他们的狗命\N{\fnArial\fs30}In advance of joining their ranks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.05,0:17:33.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不必拿刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will have no need of that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.85,0:17:35.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟坎莎拉的死无关\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had no hand in Canthara's fate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.81,0:17:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个让她凄惨离世的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The one who commanded her so rudely from this world{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.16,0:17:45.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,再也不能作恶了\N{\fnArial\fs30}will never again cause harm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.03,0:17:47.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道害她性命的禽兽是谁吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know the animal that took her life?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.18,0:17:54.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,一只乳臭未干的羔羊 自以为是恶狼\N{\fnArial\fs30}A bleating sheep who mistook himself as fearsome wolf.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.29,0:17:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他已经中计 必死无疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maneuvered towards deserved slaughter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.30,0:18:02.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我愿不惜一切 看他受苦受难\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would give all to lay eyes upon his suffering.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.37,0:18:09.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们为他的死来庆祝一下吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us take comfort in thoughts of blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.32,0:18:14.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,肉体的温暖 活人的欢愉\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the warmth of flesh, yet among the living…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.30,0:19:14.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么抓到的不是克拉苏\N{\fnArial\fs30}What of Crassus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.82,0:19:17.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,引他上钩的计划出了点意外\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plan to lure him to his doom falls short of mark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.18,0:19:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay your hand!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.44,0:19:30.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不希望这小子和他的人轻易就死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would not have the boy and his men fall to errant wrath!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.16,0:19:36.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的血还有更大的用途\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their blood is to serve higher purpose!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.26,0:19:39.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,角斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Games?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.99,0:19:41.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,祭奠死者\N{\fnArial\fs30}To honor the fallen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.08,0:19:44.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,宽慰那些还活着的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And give comfort to those left in death's wake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.37,0:19:56.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我见过这把剑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have seen this before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.67,0:19:59.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,在克雷斯的手中\N{\fnArial\fs30}In Crixus' hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.51,0:20:04.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,那小崽子在战场上拿这把剑…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the boy's upon field of battle as it…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.59,0:20:05.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的名字叫提比略\N{\fnArial\fs30}His name is Tiberius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.48,0:20:09.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,是马科斯•克拉苏的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is the son of Marcus Crassus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.13,0:20:13.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他现在正与他的一帮士兵关在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}He stands prisoner with a clutch of his soldiers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.24,0:20:26.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要把他千刀万剐\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will have his fucking life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.27,0:20:28.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们暂且留着他的小命\N{\fnArial\fs30}The reason he yet clings to it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.27,0:20:31.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们搭起柴堆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us build pyre{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.28,0:20:35.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,聚拢在假想中的传奇竞技场上\N{\fnArial\fs30}and gather around imagined sands of storied arena.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.73,0:20:40.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,庄重地看那沙场上刀剑相交\N{\fnArial\fs30}To bear solemn witness to the clash of sword and shield.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.92,0:20:47.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,向高卢战神致以最后的敬意\N{\fnArial\fs30}And pay final tribute to the Undefeated Gaul.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.57,0:20:54.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的英勇将永存我心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who shall forever stand so in my eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.62,0:21:00.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不久之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was a time not along ago{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.08,0:21:01.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他质疑你的权威\N{\fnArial\fs30}when he turned from you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.05,0:21:04.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些都是我怂恿的\N{\fnArial\fs30}A thing I moved him towards.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.09,0:21:07.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去的事常常不能如愿\N{\fnArial\fs30}The past is seldom as we would have it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.84,0:21:10.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,但未来在我们手中\N{\fnArial\fs30}The future yet to be known.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.88,0:21:14.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,拥抱当下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Embrace the present, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.92,0:21:18.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,别的什么都不要想了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and strike all else from concern.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.75,0:21:29.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,那便来一场角斗吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us have your games.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.37,0:21:34.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,每一滴溅出的罗马人的鲜血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Each drop of Roman blood spilled{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.81,0:21:39.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,都在向那些逝去的人致意\N{\fnArial\fs30}in honor of those who have been taken from us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.93,0:21:44.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,死吧 罗马狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Die Roman dog!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.95,0:22:05.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认识这一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know this one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.76,0:22:14.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,来自莱茵河东岸的艾力冈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agron. From the lands east of the Rhine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.44,0:22:18.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,野蛮民族 他们连自己人都不信任\N{\fnArial\fs30}A savage people, holding no trust even among their own kind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.11,0:22:19.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一个有些不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one is of a difference.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.03,0:22:23.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是斯巴达克斯身边的要人\N{\fnArial\fs30}A gladiator standing beside Spartacus in valued position, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.75,0:22:25.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,就连凯尔特人甘尼克斯和阵亡的高卢人\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Celt Gannicus and the fallen Gaul{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.99,0:22:27.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不过跟他平起平坐\N{\fnArial\fs30}his only equals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.35,0:22:29.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他开口没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has he given voice?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.62,0:22:31.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,骂声不断 统帅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only to rude curse, Imperator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.24,0:22:33.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还没骂完呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is yet more upon tongue, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.85,0:22:35.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这些该死的贱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}you fucking cunts…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.34,0:22:38.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,都半死不活了\N{\fnArial\fs30}More dead than living, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.27,0:22:41.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,还骂得这么起劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}yet still conjures breath toward insult.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.37,0:22:44.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很想拥有这样的角斗士\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would care to own gladiators such as this, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.76,0:22:47.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好磨砺一番这个顽固的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}and turn hard men toward harder purpose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.31,0:22:51.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我倒是想看顽石点头\N{\fnArial\fs30}As I would see this one softened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.17,0:22:55.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,将他钉在十字架上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nail him to cross…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.49,0:22:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,给那些不肯乖乖开口的人一个警示\N{\fnArial\fs30}stand warning to all who refuse to break proper word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.31,0:23:11.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我他妈迟早要将你的头砍下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall yet… have your fucking head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.19,0:23:21.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,想法不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}An impressive feat, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.03,0:23:24.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,只可惜你再也不能用剑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}For one who will never again grasp sword…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.20,0:24:19.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是跟随斯巴达克斯的人都有这种下场就好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would that all who follow Spartacus shared like fate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.71,0:24:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,统帅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Imperator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.12,0:24:27.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,庞培的使者到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}An envoy from Pompey has arrived.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.32,0:24:29.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,提比略呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What of Tiberius?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.28,0:24:31.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他并未和他们一道前来\N{\fnArial\fs30}He does not stand among them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.36,0:24:35.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,克拉苏统帅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Imperator Crassus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.48,0:24:37.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从庞培总督那里带来口信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I carry message from Proconsul Pompeius{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.73,0:24:38.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的儿子呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is my son?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.34,0:24:40.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,您的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your son…?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.96,0:24:42.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,和你们的两个信使一道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dispatched with two of your reflection{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.86,0:24:44.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,找你们的将军谈话去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}to break word with your commander.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.71,0:24:47.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我对您的儿子一无所知\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apologies, I know nothing of your son, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.60,0:24:49.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,派到您这儿来的只有我\N{\fnArial\fs30}nor others sent to you in my place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.09,0:24:51.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是唯一的信使\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am sole envoy{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.48,0:24:53.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时他们身上戴有庞培的徽章\N{\fnArial\fs30}They stood before me bearing fucking mark of Pompey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.85,0:24:55.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,有其他信使派出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Other messengers were dispatched.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.61,0:24:56.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不是到您这里的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet not to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.30,0:25:03.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,有没有信使未返回营地的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have any failed to report?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.99,0:25:06.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一队往拉丁姆去的信使下落不明\N{\fnArial\fs30}A clutch of men, heading south towards Latium.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.59,0:25:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,下去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.18,0:25:18.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是斯巴达克斯的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were Spartacus' men, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.42,0:25:20.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,装扮成庞培士兵的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}posing as Pompey's.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.68,0:25:21.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不可能知道的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can not know this{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.96,0:25:25.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,可你该知道 你在希留爱沙的叛贼当中待过\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do should have! You stood among the rebels in Sinuessa!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.52,0:25:27.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,城里有数以千计的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There were thousands within the city.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.31,0:25:29.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要是能认出那家伙是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fortune would be most kind for me to know{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.95,0:25:31.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,简直是撞了大运\N{\fnArial\fs30}the one that presented himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.49,0:25:33.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,诸神把我们害惨了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gods rain shit upon us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.83,0:25:37.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,亏得诸神保佑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet is it not blessing, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.65,0:25:40.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,没让你掉进叛贼所设的陷阱\N{\fnArial\fs30}that they stayed you from being ensnared in clever plot?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.62,0:25:43.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是统帅你死于斯巴达克斯之手\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the Imperator were to fall to Spartacus{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.45,0:25:45.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,提比略现在生死未卜 不要乱说\N{\fnArial\fs30}We do not know that Tiberius has fallen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.29,0:25:48.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是克拉苏家族的一员\N{\fnArial\fs30}He carries the name of Crassus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.68,0:25:51.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我愿意拿世上所有的财物换他一命\N{\fnArial\fs30}And with him the worth of the world towards bargain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.52,0:25:55.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你相信他还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}You believe him alive?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.74,0:25:57.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,和任何父亲一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}As any father would, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.01,0:25:59.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,活要见人 死要见尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}absent eyes laid upon lifeless form.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.71,0:26:04.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么我们祈祷事情有好的结果吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we must pray towards proper outcome, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.53,0:26:06.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,等待斯巴达克斯把你儿子…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and wait for Spartacus to return{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.21,0:26:08.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会在我儿子命悬一线之时\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will not stand idle while my son's life{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.31,0:26:10.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,还无所作为\N{\fnArial\fs30}dangles by fraying thread.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.21,0:26:16.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道斯巴达克斯的行军方向\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know which direction Spartacus heads{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.70,0:26:19.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,一小队人快马加鞭就可以赶上他并与其谈判\N{\fnArial\fs30}A few men fleet upon horse could overtake him and broach trade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.65,0:26:21.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯一看到你就会动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spartacus will kill you upon sight, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.58,0:26:23.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,不计代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}regardless of cost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.86,0:26:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我派鲁弗斯去执行任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall set Rufus towards task.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.89,0:26:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我倒是认为某个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would place trust in someone{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.40,0:26:35.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,更熟悉斯巴达克斯及其走狗的人比较适合\N{\fnArial\fs30}with greater knowledge of Spartacus and his horde.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.33,0:26:39.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,某人曾经潜伏在其中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone who's lived among them, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.59,0:26:42.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,对他们的把戏一清二楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}and knows of their treacherous ways.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.18,0:26:49.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这是让我去送死\N{\fnArial\fs30}You would send me to my death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.98,0:26:51.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不会对你动手的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They will not lay hand upon you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.40,0:26:55.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们手里有斯巴达克斯想要的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We hold something I'm certain Spartacus desires.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.44,0:26:56.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是你错了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you are in error?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.67,0:26:59.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我就为你哀悼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I shall mourn your passing as well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.61,0:27:17.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这帮混账\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fucking shits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.22,0:27:20.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这都怪我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hold share of blame.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.04,0:27:25.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我急于取悦父亲 才不慎上了钩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I latched upon bait lured with praise and paternal pride.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.46,0:27:28.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他肯定知道那些人是斯巴达克斯的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He must have known they stood Spartacus' men, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.76,0:27:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,伪装而成的\N{\fnArial\fs30}draped in false mantle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.22,0:27:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,等叫到我们时 不要跟他们打\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not raise weapon when called upon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.99,0:27:38.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们宁死也不能成为他们的玩物\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will not give entertainment in our deaths.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.42,0:27:41.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住 我们是罗马人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember that we are Romans, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.91,0:27:44.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们只是该死的奴隶\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they nothing but slaves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.31,0:27:46.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,可戴着镣铐的是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet you are the one in chains.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.85,0:27:49.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是觉得很重\N{\fnArial\fs30}A heavy thing, is it not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.12,0:27:52.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为主人一时性起就宣判你的命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}To be so condemned to the whims of a master?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.59,0:27:56.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从来没有戴过镣铐\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were never placed in chains.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.31,0:27:58.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你亲手给我戴上的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You forged them with your own hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.22,0:28:01.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,将无形的镣铐戴在我心头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Each unseen link binding heart{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.33,0:28:04.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,逼迫我离开你父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}forcing me from the arms of your father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.49,0:28:08.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮我逃走 我就让你回到他的身边\N{\fnArial\fs30}See me from these chains, and I shall return you to them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.39,0:28:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管发生了什么事 克芮\N{\fnArial\fs30}His heart yet beats for you, Kore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.81,0:28:13.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他仍然深爱着你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Despite all that has happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.53,0:28:18.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还爱着我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He still hold love for me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.27,0:28:20.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了你 他愿意付出一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}And would move the heavens to regain you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.97,0:28:25.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想都不敢想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have not dared to hope such a thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.62,0:28:29.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gratitude.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.63,0:28:39.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,夜幕降临时我会再来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Know that I shall return at night fall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.60,0:28:43.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,看你是怎么死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}When it is your time to die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.29,0:28:46.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经渴盼许久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A thing I long to lay eyes upon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.65,0:30:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,距离我当角斗士的那会儿已经很久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been a lifetime since I last stood gladiator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.91,0:30:29.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想杀人 不想要什么头衔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Title and purpose I never desired.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.99,0:30:36.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗马却逼迫我和许多兄弟这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rome forced such upon me and many of my brothers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.75,0:30:39.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,今夜\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this night…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.07,0:30:42.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们以牙还牙\N{\fnArial\fs30}we shall return favor!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.27,0:30:51.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,让克拉苏之子和他的鹰犬们见识一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us show the son of Crassus and his men{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.36,0:30:55.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在罗马的淫威之下\N{\fnArial\fs30}what we have learned beneath the heel{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.25,0:30:57.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,学到了什么本事\N{\fnArial\fs30}of their mighty Republic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.90,0:30:59.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们以此\N{\fnArial\fs30}And in such lesson, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.53,0:31:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,用罗马之血\N{\fnArial\fs30}honor the dead{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.44,0:31:05.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,祭奠阵亡将士\N{\fnArial\fs30}with Roman blood!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.81,0:31:42.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很想知道你的感受\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would know what challenge you present.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.89,0:31:45.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有战友 孤身作战\N{\fnArial\fs30}Absent legions to give aid, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.77,0:31:51.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像你们对克雷斯和艾力冈所做的那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}as they did against Crixus and Agron.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.38,0:32:02.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Begin!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.91,0:32:15.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是罗马人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am a Roman!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.13,0:32:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我他妈的才不会为了取悦你们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will not fight for your fucking entertainment{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.69,0:32:39.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,不想打 那就统统杀死\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will fight, or fall where you stand!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.24,0:32:44.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然罗马人没有勇气独自面对我\N{\fnArial\fs30}If a single Roman lacks courage enough to face me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.95,0:32:46.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就两个一起上\N{\fnArial\fs30}send two to brace nerve!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.72,0:33:50.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没看过这种比赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have never laid eyes upon the games.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.04,0:33:56.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,让人回想起昔日的荣耀\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are but dim reflection of their glory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.99,0:34:01.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好像还很向往这种日子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You speak as if heart yearns for such days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.88,0:34:12.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,回到镣铐加身的时代吗 才不\N{\fnArial\fs30}To return to shackle and lash, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.45,0:34:16.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,重温脚下的血与沙\N{\fnArial\fs30}To stand upon the sands again…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.67,0:34:21.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,认清自我\N{\fnArial\fs30}To know a clear purpose{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.64,0:34:24.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,和肩负的使命\N{\fnArial\fs30}of who you are and what must be done…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.03,0:34:30.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才是召唤我们的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is a thing that calls to all of my kind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.82,0:36:50.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要更多的血\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would have more blood, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.45,0:36:52.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,来祭奠我的兄弟克雷斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}to honor my brother Crixus{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.42,0:36:54.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,和所有跟随他英勇赴死的兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}and all who have followed him to the afterlife!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.34,0:36:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,甘尼克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gannicus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.75,0:36:58.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take position!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.86,0:37:04.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,二打一毫无难度可言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two Romans seem to deliver no contest!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.47,0:37:11.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,一次来三个 才够祭奠我兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send three, so that I may deliver proper tribute!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.55,0:37:28.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,甘尼克斯想要打败你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gannicus seeks to best you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.09,0:37:30.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,角斗士都想击败所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gladiators seek to best all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.75,0:37:33.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有这样才能在竞技场存活下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is the only way to survive in the arena.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.20,0:37:58.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我们这些人里 只有甘尼克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gannicus stands the only among us{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.14,0:38:01.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,在竞技场赢得了自由之身\N{\fnArial\fs30}to win his freedom upon the sands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.11,0:38:07.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然已经自由了 他干吗还要帮奴隶\N{\fnArial\fs30}If free, why does he raise arms with the slaves{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.05,0:38:08.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,对抗共和国\N{\fnArial\fs30}against the Republic?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.77,0:38:14.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他投身起义是为了纪念一位死去的兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}He took up cause to honor a fallen brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.52,0:38:17.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,那位兄弟教会了我们如何战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}One that taught us the ways of battle{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.12,0:38:20.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及让所有人团结一心的兄弟情谊\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the bond that joins all men in such pursuit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.02,0:38:39.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你受不了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It holds difficulty?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.99,0:38:42.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着你的族人死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}To see one of your people fall?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.67,0:38:50.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我早就和他们划清界限了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They no longer stand as such.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.66,0:38:55.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被共和国所抛弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have been cast from the Republic, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.60,0:38:57.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,对于死亡和伤痛已经见怪不怪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}with less thought towards loss or suffering.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.32,0:39:01.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也许会逃避这些血腥场面\N{\fnArial\fs30}I may flinch from gory sight…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.65,0:39:06.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,但要知道我很享受其中的意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}yet know that I revel in its meaning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.91,0:40:19.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,只当你代表一千条罗马狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would that you stood a thousand men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.30,0:40:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要亲手了断你 祭奠艾力冈在天之灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your deaths by my hand worthy of Agron's memory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.48,0:40:44.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你准备好最后一战了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stand prepared for final contest?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.34,0:40:49.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,克雷斯曾吹嘘他在竞技场上多么厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crixus once boasted of his prowess as a gladiator, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.26,0:40:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是他第一次跟我讲话的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}in first words he ever broke with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.77,0:40:54.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当时说我不喜欢角斗比赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said I did not favor the games…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.20,0:40:59.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现在我只求一战\N{\fnArial\fs30}now they are all that I long for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.83,0:41:02.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定是他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're certain that's him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.03,0:41:06.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,别放松防守\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not lower guard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.02,0:41:13.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在说谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who do you speak of?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.67,0:41:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个我很想见的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}One I long to greet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.93,0:41:27.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我提的是公平交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}I offer fair trade!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.79,0:41:29.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿提比略的性命来换\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five hundred of your men{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.66,0:41:33.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们被克拉苏所俘的五百个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}taken in battle against Crassus for Tiberius' life{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.83,0:41:36.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.96,0:41:38.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会考虑你的条件\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would hear of this{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.42,0:41:42.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说他还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}He lives then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.85,0:41:43.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,那小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The boy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.91,0:41:44.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.69,0:41:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,暂时还没死\N{\fnArial\fs30}For yet a moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.70,0:41:49.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还嫌这卑鄙小人骗你不够惨吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me you do not fall prey to this viper's tongue?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.43,0:41:51.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个条件不是我开的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The words they form are not my own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.11,0:41:55.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们别以为我会傻到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not think me the fool to greet you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.95,0:41:58.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,主动跑来找你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}with willful fucking intent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.59,0:42:00.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,克拉苏竟然会开出这种条件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crassus would offer such a bargain?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.38,0:42:03.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了那个该死的臭小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}He would offer Jupiter's throne in return{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.09,0:42:06.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他连朱庇特的王座都可以给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}for festering disease that sprung from noble loins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.79,0:42:10.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他肯定又设了个套 诱骗我们往里面钻\N{\fnArial\fs30}He but attempts to draw us into another plot turning upon itself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.07,0:42:11.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他设个屁的套\N{\fnArial\fs30}He attempts nothing!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.34,0:42:12.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙脑袋一根筋\N{\fnArial\fs30}The man is of singular mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.71,0:42:14.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可没有他那么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}One I do not fucking share{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.72,0:42:19.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,五百人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five hundred?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.84,0:42:24.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你很想杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take my life as I know you desire…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.09,0:42:27.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我死了他们也没命\N{\fnArial\fs30}and end theirs as well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.50,0:42:40.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,操他妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck the Gods.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.78,0:42:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没有辱没艾力冈的威名\N{\fnArial\fs30}You honored Agron well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.44,0:42:49.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你也不辱克雷斯的威名\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you shall honor Crixus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.93,0:43:12.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,献给你们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}For you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.46,0:43:42.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,把剑还给我 奴隶\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would have my sword returned to me, slave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.54,0:43:45.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说这剑是你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You claim the sword as your own?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.38,0:43:50.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,可这手感\N{\fnArial\fs30}The way it fits hand, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.58,0:43:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是给女人 就是给小屁孩打造的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought it forged for woman or sickly child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.17,0:44:27.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还当我是小屁孩吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you yet consider me sickly child?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.25,0:44:38.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样打起来才有意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}I find you more than expected.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.04,0:45:22.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢 我还担心你死得太快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gratitude. I held worries you would die to quickly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.43,0:45:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要取你狗命\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will have your life…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.56,0:45:36.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像我干掉那该死的高卢人一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}As I took the fucking Gaul's{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.05,0:46:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在就把这剑还给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would see blade returned to you now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.15,0:46:35.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,妮维雅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Naevia!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.63,0:46:47.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,别急着下手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take pause.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.47,0:46:55.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,克拉苏提了个条件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crassus offers trade!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.49,0:47:01.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,用他儿子的命 换克雷斯手下五百人的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}His son's life for five hundred captured in battle with Crixus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.98,0:47:04.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,干掉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let her finish him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.03,0:47:14.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过是罗马狗的谎言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another Roman lie!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.84,0:47:19.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信不是谎言\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not believe it so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.54,0:47:27.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我把选择权交给受这小子伤害最深的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet I lay choice with the one most wronged by the boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.48,0:48:15.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的性命在我手中\N{\fnArial\fs30}I held your life in my hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.58,0:48:21.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你活着的每一刻都知道 总有一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Live each moment knowing that one day soon{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.32,0:48:23.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会取你狗命\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall reclaim it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.86,0:48:42.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就不担心上当吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are yet feel come skin conceiving bitter end?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.28,0:48:45.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,克拉苏不会拿他儿子的命冒险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crassus will not risk in cost of one he loves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.21,0:48:48.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,当初我们也是这样想葛雷博和他妻子的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We thought the same upon Glaber towards his wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.03,0:48:53.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,有信了 我们有几百个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have received words. Hundreds of our people{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.24,0:48:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,正往约定的人质交换地点前进\N{\fnArial\fs30}march towards where agreed upon to exchange Roman soldiers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.86,0:48:59.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,把提比略带过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take Tiberius to there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.64,0:49:03.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,保证那小子的生命安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seize the boy's life so set upon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.51,0:49:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了他 杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill them! Fucking kill him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.54,0:49:32.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要的人我已经带到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Delivered into hands, as agreed upon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.38,0:49:33.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有话跟他说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would break words.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.49,0:49:36.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他离开温暖的怀抱太久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has been too long from embrace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.61,0:49:50.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到你还活着 真让人振奋\N{\fnArial\fs30}It lifts heart. To see you yet of this world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.55,0:49:52.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,少跟我油嘴滑舌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not ply me with silver tongue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.09,0:49:56.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道那些庞培的人是斯巴达克斯的人假扮的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You knew them to be Spartacus' men, under guise of Pompey's.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.05,0:49:58.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这话好大胆\N{\fnArial\fs30}A bold claim.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.01,0:50:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父亲肯定会听进我的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well one my father will surely take interest in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.49,0:50:04.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,送你回他身边的旅程可是危险重重\N{\fnArial\fs30}The journey to return you to his arms is fraught with peril.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.74,0:50:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤其对于你这种不教训不知道天高地厚的小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}For one needing to be taught severest lesson in who towers above you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.18,0:50:13.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.09,0:50:55.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个疯婊子 知道你做了什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mad bitch. Do you know what you have done?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.03,0:50:56.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是讨回公道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have balanced fucking scale.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.50,0:51:03.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们五百个兄弟都将因此受难\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five hundred of our people will suffer for this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.06,0:51:06.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在这小子毫无价值\N{\fnArial\fs30}The boy holds no value now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.87,0:51:08.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,恺撒也一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nor does life of Caesar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.37,0:51:12.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 克拉苏会如约交易的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait! Crassus will yet honor trade!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.68,0:51:16.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要他得到另一样他所渴望的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you give him something else his heart desires.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.08,0:51:36.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一个叛贼杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was struck down by hand of rebel slave, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.07,0:51:40.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在我们从斯巴达克斯的营地撤出来的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}as we attempted to withdraw from Spartacus' camp.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.16,0:51:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那人上了年纪 主人给他刻的标记\N{\fnArial\fs30}A man long of years, the scars of his master{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.70,0:51:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,深深地烙进了肉里\N{\fnArial\fs30}etched deep upon flesh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.46,0:51:54.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你还履行了交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yet you held to fucking bargain?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.69,0:51:57.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你必然伤痛欲绝\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew wound such loss would cause.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.56,0:52:00.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,当发现有机会抚平你的伤痛 我便出手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sought only to balm it with opportunity presented…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.63,0:52:12.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 盖乌斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gratitude, Gaius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.91,0:52:16.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在代我行使权力\N{\fnArial\fs30}You now stand my Word and my Will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.70,0:52:18.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,受你重托\N{\fnArial\fs30}You honor me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.14,0:52:20.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备行军\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prepare the men for march.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.35,0:52:24.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要大举进攻斯巴达克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would press towards Spartacus{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.55,0:52:29.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,要他死无葬身之地\N{\fnArial\fs30}and see him to deserved end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.11,0:52:31.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,遵命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Imperator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.86,0:52:59.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Raise eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.18,0:53:06.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,马科斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marcus{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.60,0:53:16.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,从今以后\N{\fnArial\fs30}From this day forth…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.00,0:53:21.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要认清我主人的身份\N{\fnArial\fs30}you shall address me as Dominus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.18,0:53:47.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,真希望我们的爱人也在人群当中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would that those we held to heart stood among them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.98,0:53:52.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,纳西尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nasir…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.26,0:54:21.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,诸神把你送回我怀里\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gods return you to my arms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.10,0:54:23.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,离开你是我太傻了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was fool to ever leave them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.35,0:55:22.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚 我们与本以为再也见不到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This night hearts lift in joyous reunion{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.21,0:55:23.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,兄弟相会 这是大喜事\N{\fnArial\fs30}with those thought lost to us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.18,0:55:27.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,父亲们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fathers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.20,0:55:30.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,兄弟姐妹们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brothers and sisters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.66,0:55:33.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,儿子与爱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sons and lovers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.25,0:55:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,在罗马阴影的笼罩下 我们紧紧相拥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold them close for the shadow of Rome is upon us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.02,0:55:43.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们今后同呼吸共命运\N{\fnArial\fs30}We shall seek our destiny together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.81,0:55:46.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论代价如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever the cost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.70,0:55:52.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们永远不要忘记\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet let us not pass from memory{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.85,0:55:55.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些离开了我们的兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}those left absent from our arms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.54,0:55:58.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些牺牲他们的生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those who sacrificed their lives{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.56,0:56:01.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,换来我们自由生活的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}so that all may live free.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.45,0:56:18.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,克雷斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}For Crixus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.20,0:56:44.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}For Sura.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.52,0:56:47.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,维罗和米拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}For Varro and Mira!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.97,0:56:51.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥诺玛默斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}For Oenomaus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.77,0:56:53.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪欧特莫斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}For Diotimus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.98,0:56:56.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱斯克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}For Rhaskos.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.96,0:56:58.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,赛纳斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}For Sanus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.72,0:57:00.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,多纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Donar!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.35,0:57:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,杜罗\N{\fnArial\fs30}For Duro!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.72,0:57:03.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}For Aca.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.60,0:57:05.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,佛蒂斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fortis!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.51,0:57:06.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴尔卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Barca!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.26,0:57:08.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,纳美特斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nemetes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.54,0:57:09.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,李斯卡斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Liscus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.68,0:57:12.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,克雷斯 克雷斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}For Crixus! Crixus! Crixus…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.89,0:57:14.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,克雷斯 克雷斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crixus! Crixus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.89,0:57:18.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,克雷斯 克雷斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crixus! Crixus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.12,0:57:22.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,克雷斯 克雷斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crixus! Crixus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.34,0:57:25.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,克雷斯 克雷斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crixus! Crixus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.58,0:57:38.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他的名字回荡天际 刺破苍穹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Split heavens with the sound of his name!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.89,0:57:43.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,要克拉苏和庞培知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let it carry to Crassus and Pompey{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.94,0:57:48.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这洪钟雷鸣 是腥风血雨的前奏\N{\fnArial\fs30}as distant thunder promising storm and blood!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.72,0:57:54.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们尚能一战的兄弟将向罗马发起最后一击\N{\fnArial\fs30}All those who are able shall make final stand against Rome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.00,0:57:57.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在此发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this I promise you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.00,0:58:03.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要么自由生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will live free…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.14,0:58:07.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,要么与兄弟黄泉相见\N{\fnArial\fs30}or join our brothers in death!{\r}
